Subject: Justification for Cantor M2B Windows Platform Preflight Runtime

& [Claim] is activation bounded
  + [statement] implement one isolated root-only Windows preflight now that its request, result, ABI, ownership, and fault provenance are explicit
  + [confidence] is high for the implementation boundary and conditional for the first physical result

& [Support] is concrete
  + [forms] profile 0.2 can honestly carry open, query, local, and complete outcomes
  + [ABI] windows-sys 0.61.2 functions, structures, constants, and features are compile proven
  + [ownership] OwnedHandle closes on drop after one valid FromRawHandle transfer
  + [buffers] every selected query has one closed fixed allocation
  + [fixture] the exact ignored local root confines mutation and observation

& [WhyNewCrate] is containment
  + [false_option] relax unsafe_code across cantor_ecosystem
  + [rejection] that would broaden the trusted computing base and weaken an already pure crate
  + [solution] one target-specific crate denies unsafe by default and allows one private module

& [WhySixBlocks] is auditability
  + [reason] each FFI or ownership transition has distinct invariants and immediate error obligations
  + [result] source count and line-specific safety comments are mechanically reviewable

& [WhyRuntimeProvenanceFault] is honesty preserving
  + [condition] a Windows function reports failure but immediate GetLastError is zero
  + [forms_limit] proven OS faults require nonzero codes and open has no local observation stage
  + [solution] OperatingSystemErrorUnavailable carries the exact open or query operation without a code, partial evidence, or result claim

& [WhyPhysicalProbe] is evidence
  + [reason] generated ABI availability does not establish actual target-host behavior
  + [limit] one opt-in exact-root probe proves only its emitted facts
  + [honesty] unexpected outcomes are preserved and block, not normalized

& [Counterarguments] are answered
  + [counterargument] use std::fs canonicalize and metadata only
  + [answer] those APIs do not expose the required 128-bit identity, volume-GUID final path, volume record, or remote protocol record
  + [counterargument] put all calls in one large unsafe block
  + [answer] broad scope obscures the separate pointer, initialization, ownership, and error invariants
  + [counterargument] implement the scanner in the same slice
  + [answer] root platform eligibility is a prerequisite and does not justify traversal or content authority

& [Invalidation] is explicit
  + [condition] source drift, dependency drift, new call, new unsafe block, delayed or fabricated error, invented stage, ownership ambiguity, fixture escape, unexpected physical result, failed gate, or stale evidence
  + [response] stop, preserve the fault, and reprocess before further effects

& [Rollback] is direct
  + [workspace] remove the new member
  + [crate] remove cantor_windows_preflight
  + [lock] remove only the local package entry and dependency edge
  + [fixture] may remain ignored historical evidence or be removed under separate cleanup authority
  + [state_migration] is none
